1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,119
Quick recap.

2
00:00:01,119 --> 00:00:06,757
The binomial theorem gives n plus one terms with coefficients n C r.

3
00:00:06,757 --> 00:00:09,570
The general term is T r plus one.

4
00:00:09,570 --> 00:00:12,890
The coefficients sum to two to the n.

5
00:00:12,890 --> 00:00:18,398
For any index the series is infinite and needs x less than one in size.

6
00:00:18,398 --> 00:00:23,294
Approximate roots by splitting off the nearest perfect power.

7
00:00:23,294 --> 00:00:26,184
And e is the sum of one over r factorial.

